Frontmatter discipline per CLAUDE.md Part 5:
  - cite_key: <first-author><year>-<topic-slug> (lowercase, hyphenated, disambiguated -a/-b if collision)
  - raw_handle: AUTO_<wishlist-row-id>
  - raw_path: relative path to the PDF
